Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 10.10.2026: «Залей в него все модели диффузные, что у нас накопились, и LoRA адаптеры, и настрой выборочное скачивание прямо в студии Художника, чтобы было всё под рукой».

Get painters and adapters… under the painter opens the Artist's own list of what the studio can fetch for it: Krea 2 Muse (or SDXL), the Qwen painters, the Qwen-Image 2512 fine-tunes and the adapters their authors let be shared, each variant with its size, here or Fetch. The fetch is Engine → Models and LoRAs' own (heresy-weights.js: its question with the size and where the painter shows, its run, its progress), the list following it through a ruach-weights event; when it ends the painters and the adapters are read again. HeresyWeights.fetchExtra takes a variant by its id.

Suite 654/0 (suite-1347.part: the sections and rows from the lab's list, the question with the size, nothing fetched when cancelled).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
